      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "COMFORTABLE TWO-BEDROOM DUPLEX-STYLE HOME PRESENTED IN EXCELLENT CONDITION, SITUATED IN AN ESTABLISHED RESIDENTIAL AREA WITHIN WALKING DISTANCE OF CAVAN TOWN CENTRE.\n\nSmith Property is delighted to offer No. 1B The Drumlins to let. This charming two-bedroom home is presented in excellent condition and enjoys picturesque views of Swellan Lake.\n\nExtending to approximately 54 sq. m, the accommodation comprises a living room, kitchen, two bedrooms and a bathroom. Situated in the established Swellan area, the property is approximately 500 metres from Cavan town centre and its amenities.\n\nViewing is highly recommended by appointment through Smith Property.\n\nReferences must be provided. Please fill out the tenancy application form."
